sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Flutter)
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant AS as Article Service
    participant DB as Article DB

    U->>GW: GET /article/{article_id}
    GW->>GW: Verify JWT
    GW->>AS: Proxy request
    AS->>DB: Query article detail
    AS->>DB: Increment view_count (article_stats)
    AS->>DB: Get reaction summary
    AS->>DB: Count comments
    AS->>DB: Get categories for article
    DB-->>AS: Article + stats + reactions + comments + categories
    AS-->>U: Article detail response

    U->>GW: POST /article/{id}/reactions
    GW->>AS: Proxy request
    AS->>DB: UPSERT article_interactions
    AS-->>U: Reaction saved

    U->>GW: POST /article/{id}/comments
    GW->>AS: Proxy request
    AS->>DB: INSERT article_comments
    AS-->>U: Comment created
